        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Spray Toxic Oil"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(conjuration, primal)\n\nThe scalathrax disgorges a gout of toxic oil from its mouth in a 15-foot cone. Creatures in the area must attempt a DC 21 Reflex save. The scalathrax can't use Toxic Oil Spray again for 1d4 rounds.\n\nCritical Success: The creature is unaffected.\nSuccess: The creature takes 1d8 poison damage.\nFailure: The creature takes 2d8 poison damage. For 1 minute, the creature gains weakness to fire 5, and whenever the creature critically fails with an attack roll with a wielded weapon, it drops the weapon.\nCritical Failure: As failure, but 4d8 poison damage."
            },
